{"id":"n78faf19c2a","headline":"Greece Plans to Repay 13 Billion Euros of Its Debt Early","summary":"Greece intends to repay 13 billion euros of its debt early this year. The step is expected to reduce the debt-to-GDP ratio and support investor confidence.","why":"Early repayment lowers a sovereign's debt burden and interest costs, which can improve creditworthiness and bond market sentiment. Greece's debt has been a central concern in the eurozone.","category":"economy","event_type":"capital","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Athens","country":"Greece","lat":37.98,"lon":23.73,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"الجزيرة نت","url":"https://www.aljazeera.net/ebusiness/2026/8/18/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%8A%D9%88%D9%86%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%AA%D8%AE%D8%B7%D8%B7-%D9%84%D8%AA%D8%B3%D8%AF%D9%8A%D8%AF-13-%D9%85%D9%84%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D9%8A%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%88-%D9%85%D9%86"},"sources":[{"name":"الجزيرة نت","url":"https://www.aljazeera.net/ebusiness/2026/8/18/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%8A%D9%88%D9%86%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%AA%D8%AE%D8%B7%D8%B7-%D9%84%D8%AA%D8%B3%D8%AF%D9%8A%D8%AF-13-%D9%85%D9%84%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%B1-%D9%8A%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%88-%D9%85%D9%86"}],"published_at":"2026-08-18T11:26:28Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T07:47:41Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"91db04315cbae1f3","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T07:47:41Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-18T11:26:28Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-18T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"GR","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"اليونان تخطط لتسديد 13 مليار يورو من ديونها مبكرا","source_language":"ara","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-4765706.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit"